# Humility takes the abilities of creatures only. Bot2's M.O.D.O.K. is a creature whose "Creatures your opponents
# control get -1/-1" is a static ability: Humility takes it (and M.O.D.O.K.'s flying and lifelink) in layer 6, so it no
# longer applies (CR 613.1f, 613.8a). Bot1's Warleader's Call is an enchantment, not a creature: its "Creatures you
# control get +1/+1" goes on applying, in layer 7c after Humility's base 1/1 (CR 613.4b, 613.4c). Bot1's Llanowar Elves
# is 1/1 before Humility (1/1, +1/+1, -1/-1) and 2/2 after it (1/1 base, +1/+1): it would be 1/1 if M.O.D.O.K.'s
# ability still applied, or if Warleader's Call's no longer did. M.O.D.O.K. itself is a 1/1 with no keywords.

